For the time being, this campaign is targeting **Android native only**.

Do not treat web or iOS as product acceptance targets for this campaign.

The Samsung Galaxy S23 should become the canonical physical/native reference device once connected.

This changes the interpretation of several earlier answers:

* S0.5: Android native only.
* iOS is deferred entirely.
