**DECISION: DEFER iOS FROM THIS CAMPAIGN.**

Do not spend campaign effort or money establishing an iOS build path.

Specifically:

* no Apple Developer account is required for this campaign;
* do not authorise Apple Developer membership expenditure;
* do not configure an iOS EAS build solely for this campaign;
* do not make iOS builds;
* do not perform iOS AR validation;
* do not create iOS-specific acceptance gates;
* do not allow inability to build iOS on Linux to block campaign completion.

The product architecture should avoid gratuitous Android-only coupling where a straightforward shared abstraction is available, but this must not turn into speculative cross-platform engineering.

Android native is the product being built and accepted now.

iOS becomes a separate future campaign after the Android-native product has reached the required quality.

